{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约伯记","commonName":"约伯记","title":"约伯记","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"1a81bb70cf0a6a7c1a1cb5467ce5d2ed020992a97cf8ea0fae07c18b9e6c434a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约伯失去健康"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["又有一天，众天使来朝见耶和华，撒旦也在他们当中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华问撒旦：“你从哪里来？”撒旦答道：“我在地上到处游走。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华问道：“你注意到我的仆人约伯了吗？世上没有人像他那样纯全正直，敬畏我，远离罪恶。虽然你鼓动我无缘无故地攻击他、毁灭他，他仍然持守自己的纯正。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["撒旦回答说：“人会以皮换皮，为了保全生命，情愿舍弃一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["倘若你伸手伤害他的骨和肉，他必当面亵渎你。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：“好吧，他在你手中，但要留他一命。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["于是，撒旦从耶和华面前退去，开始加害约伯，使他从头到脚长毒疮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["约伯坐在炉灰中，拿瓦片刮身体。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他的妻子对他说：“你还要持守自己的纯正吗？不如亵渎上帝，死掉算了！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但约伯回答说：“你说话像个愚昧的妇人。难道我们只从上帝手里接受祝福，却不接受灾殃吗？”约伯遭此不幸，仍没有犯言语之罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["约伯的三个朋友"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["约伯的三个朋友提幔人以利法、书亚人比勒达和拿玛人琐法听到他的不幸遭遇，便各自从家乡动身，相约一起来探望、安慰他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们远远地看见约伯，几乎认不出是他，禁不住放声大哭，各自撕裂外袍，扬起尘土，让土落在头上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们看到约伯极其痛苦，就陪着他在地上坐了七天七夜，没有对他说一句话。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}